@startuml
<style>
timingDiagram {
  .net { LineColor #1565C0 }
  .machine { LineColor #2E7D32 }
  constraintArrow { LineColor #B00020; FontColor #B00020 }
  highlight { BackgroundColor #FFF4D6 }
}
</style>
time-axis unit "ms"
analog "+3V3 (V)" between 0.0 and 3.6 as r3v3 <<analog>> <<net>>
binary "PG_3V3" as pg3v3 <<binary>> <<net>>
analog "+1V8 (V)" between 0.0 and 2.0 as r1v8 <<analog>> <<net>>
binary "nRESET" as nreset <<binary>> <<net>>
robust "MCU" as mcu <<robust>> <<machine>>
clock "SysTick" as sysTick with period 1 pulse 0.5 offset 7 <<clock>>
mcu has "Off" as Off
mcu has "Reset" as Reset
mcu has "ROM boot" as ROM_boot
mcu has "App init" as App_init
mcu has "Running" as Running
@0
r3v3 is 0
pg3v3 is low
r1v8 is 0
nreset is low
mcu is Off
@0.2
r3v3 is 0
@1.2
r3v3 is 3.3
@1.4
pg3v3 is high
@1.5
r1v8 is 0
@2
r1v8 is 1.8
mcu is Reset
@5.2
nreset is high
mcu is ROM_boot
@5.6
mcu is App_init
@7
mcu is Running
@10
r3v3@1.2 <-> @1.5 : t_seq {≥ 100 µs}
r1v8@1.5 <-> @2 : t_ss {300 µs – 1 ms}
nreset@1.2 <-> @5.2 : t_rst {2 ms – 5 ms}
mcu@5.2 <-> @7 : t_boot {≤ 2 ms}
pg3v3@1.4 -> r1v8@1.5 : EN
nreset@5.2 -> mcu@5.2 : resetRelease
highlight 2 to 5.2 : reset held
@enduml
